# Hash-locked tools for the API fuzzing job ONLY (#258).
#
# Kept out of requirements-ci.lock deliberately: Schemathesis pulls in
# hypothesis-jsonschema, starlette, werkzeug and a dozen more, and every one
# of them would then be installed by every cell of the test matrix on every
# OS, to be used by one job on one OS. Scorecard still requires hashes for
# the install, hence a lock of its own -- same arrangement as the mutation
# sweep and the security scan.
#
# The bridge itself is imported by scripts/serve_bridge_for_fuzzing.py, so
# the job also installs requirements-ci.lock; only the fuzzer is here.
schemathesis==4.25.2
